msgstr "An hour later"

msgid "Ask <0>Mis kell on?</0> The answer is <1>kell on</1> and the hour: <2>kell on kolm</2>."
msgstr "Ask <0>Mis kell on?</0> The answer is <1>kell on</1> and the hour: <2>kell on kolm</2>."

msgid "Ask the time and understand the answer. Halves and quarters count toward the hour that’s coming."
msgstr "Ask the time and understand the answer. Halves and quarters count toward the hour that’s coming."

msgid "at six; six o’clock"
msgstr "at six; six o’clock"

msgid "Before the hour, say how long until the next one. <0/> is, word for word, “in ten minutes, four”: 3:50."
msgstr "Before the hour, say how long until the next one. <0/> is, word for word, “in ten minutes, four”: 3:50."

msgid "clock, watch; o’clock"
msgstr "clock, watch; o’clock"

msgid "Drag the minute hand or pick the minutes, then tap play to hear the time. The hour a time is named after lights up."
msgstr "Drag the minute hand or pick the minutes, then tap play to hear the time. The hour a time is named after lights up."

msgid "Each clock fills in the part of the hour that has gone. Tap one to hear it."
msgstr "Each clock fills in the part of the hour that has gone. Tap one to hear it."

msgid "Each round shows a time in digits. Type how you say it, without <0>kell on</0>."
msgstr "Each round shows a time in digits. Type how you say it, without <0>kell on</0>."

msgid "Every one, by ear."
msgstr "Every one, by ear."

msgid "half"
msgstr "half"

msgid "Half hours"
msgstr "Half hours"

msgid "half past three, 3:30"
msgstr "half past three, 3:30"

msgid "Half past: pool"
msgstr "Half past: pool"

msgid "Halfway to {next}."
msgstr "Halfway to {next}."

msgid "Hear a time and write the whole sentence. With <0>läbi</0>, say <1>viis</1>, <2>kümme</2> or <3>kakskümmend</3>, then <4>minutit</4>; with <5>pärast</5>, <6>viie</6>, <7>kümne</7> or <8>kahekümne</8>, then <9>minuti</9>."
msgstr "Hear a time and write the whole sentence. With <0>läbi</0>, say <1>viis</1>, <2>kümme</2> or <3>kakskümmend</3>, then <4>minutit</4>; with <5>pärast</5>, <6>viie</6>, <7>kümne</7> or <8>kahekümne</8>, then <9>minuti</9>."

msgid "Here the number changes shape: <0>viis</0> becomes <1>viie</1>, <2>kümme</2> becomes <3>kümne</3>, <4>kakskümmend</4> becomes <5>kahekümne</5>. Learn these three as set phrases for now. Lesson {genitive} explains the form."
msgstr "Here the number changes shape: <0>viis</0> becomes <1>viie</1>, <2>kümme</2> becomes <3>kümne</3>, <4>kakskümmend</4> becomes <5>kahekümne</5>. Learn these three as set phrases for now. Lesson {genitive} explains the form."

msgid "Hour"
msgstr "Hour"

msgid "In {ahead} minutes it’s {next}."
msgstr "In {ahead} minutes it’s {next}."

msgid "in words"
msgstr "in words"

msgid "It’s {digits}: <0>{words}</0>."
msgstr "It’s {digits}: <0>{words}</0>."

msgid "It’s {right}: <0>{words}</0> is halfway to {next}."
msgstr "It’s {right}: <0>{words}</0> is halfway to {next}."

msgid "It’s three o’clock."
msgstr "It’s three o’clock."

msgid "Kell with a time also says when: kell kuus, at six."
msgstr "Kell with a time also says when: kell kuus, at six."

msgid "Kolm, three, and veerand, a quarter."
msgstr "Kolm, three, and veerand, a quarter."

msgid "Kümme minutit kolm läbi: 3:10."
msgstr "Kümme minutit kolm läbi: 3:10."

msgid "Kümne is the form kümme takes before minuti pärast."
msgstr "Kümne is the form kümme takes before minuti pärast."

msgid "Kümne minuti pärast neli: in ten minutes it’s four, 3:50."
msgstr "Kümne minuti pärast neli: in ten minutes it’s four, 3:50."

msgid "Läbi or pärast?"
msgstr "Läbi or pärast?"

msgid "Listen and pick the clock. The others are an hour out, or another time named after the same hour, such as 3:15 and 3:45."
msgstr "Listen and pick the clock. The others are an hour out, or another time named after the same hour, such as 3:15 and 3:45."

msgid "Listen and type the time in digits, such as 3:30 or 3.30."
msgstr "Listen and type the time in digits, such as 3:30 or 3.30."

msgid "Listen for pool, veerand, kolmveerand, läbi or pärast. Each tells you which hour to count from."
msgstr "Listen for pool, veerand, kolmveerand, läbi or pärast. Each tells you which hour to count from."

msgid "Listen: a message from Mari"
msgstr "Listen: a message from Mari"

msgid "Listening only, no microphone"
msgstr "Listening only, no microphone"

msgid "Listening: a message from Mari"
msgstr "Listening: a message from Mari"

msgid "Mari is at work now."
msgstr "Mari is at work now."

msgid "Mari leaves Jaan a message about her afternoon. Without <0>on</0>, <1/> says when: at six. Listen for each time."
msgstr "Mari leaves Jaan a message about her afternoon. Without <0>on</0>, <1/> says when: at six. Listen for each time."

